msgid "通用分类模型"
msgstr "Universal classification model"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:9
msgid "Zero-shot 图像分类，支持为每个标签提供多个提示/描述词，无需训练即可输出类别及置信度。"
msgstr ""
"Zero-shot image classification supports multiple hints/descriptors for each "
"label, and can output categories and confidence without training."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:12
msgid "输入/输出"
msgstr "input/output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:14
msgid "输入（Input）: - 图像（来自上游节点或工作流输入）"
msgstr "Input: - Image (from upstream node or workflow input)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:17
msgid "输出（Output）: - 预测的类别标签及置信度 - Top-K 排序结果（按置信度降序）"
msgstr ""
"Output: - Predicted category labels and confidence - Top-K sorting results "
"(in descending order of confidence)"

