msgstr "``input.image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:40
msgid "分类标签"
msgstr "Classification tags"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_classification.rst:41
msgid "使用 JSON 配置，每个标签可给出多个提示/描述词。描述越具体（外观、材质、用途等）分类越准确。"
msgstr ""
"Using JSON configuration, multiple hints/descriptors can be given per "
"tag.The more specific the description (appearance, material, use, etc.), the"
" more accurate the classification."

